# INVWINA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Windows ends its
# session (Q) while the item form is open with a change made.  The
# frame agrees, as no request is outstanding, and the run ends there:
# the snapshot after Q shows the form as WM_ENDSESSION left it, and no
# key reaches the program again.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINA.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER DOWN CTRL-E
T C
S EDIT
Q
S ENDED
